e; the chapel is brighter than it used to be.","zh":"旅人，若是累了，便进来坐坐。近来点烛的人多，堂里倒比往日亮些。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The snow on the heights is late melting this year. The sheep still can't get up to the high pasture, so they're on hay.","zh":"山上的雪今年化得晚，羊到现在还上不了高处的草场，只能喂干草。"}}]}}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk0.s0.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk0"}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk0.s0.1","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk0"}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk0.s0.2","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk0"}},{"type":"item/vessel/flask/holy_water","id":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk0.s1.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk0.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk0.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk0.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk0.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk1","type":"actor/person/traveler","name":{"en":"Gregory Chalkman","zh":"格里高利·垩人"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"altar.whitewick-shrine","x":14,"y":12},"facing":"down","props":{"age":31,"household":"altar.whitewick-shrine.h0","purse":3,"favourite":"item/material/flower"},"contents":["altar.whitewick-shrine.folk1.coin0","altar.whitewick-shrine.folk1.coin1","altar.whitewick-shrine.folk1.coin2"],"look":{"body":"man","parts":{"hair":"hair.ponytail","face":"face.keen","outfit":"outfit.tunic","shoes":"shoes.boots"},"colors":{"skin":"fair","hair":"rose","eyes":"storm","outfit.1":"forest","shoes.1":"darkleather"}},"npc":{"role":"traveler","schedule":[{"from":21,"to":7,"map":"altar.whitewick-shrine","x":14,"y":12,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":7,"to":12,"map":"altar.whitewick-shrine","x":14,"y":15,"activity":"work"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"altar.whitewick-shrine","x":14,"y":12,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"altar.whitewick-shrine","x":14,"y":15,"activity":"work"},{"from":18,"to":21,"map":"altar.whitewick-shrine","x":14,"y":12,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello. I haven't seen you before. Are you from out of town?","zh":"你好。没见过你，是外地来的吧？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Six days on the road to get here, and I've worn through my soles. Is there a cobbler round here?","zh":"我走了六天才到这儿，鞋底都磨穿了。这附近有补鞋的吗？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The Church named me for the pilgrimage. They say it is calling people everywhere; of every ten I meet on the road, three or four are on the same errand.","zh":"教会点了我的名，叫我去朝圣。听说各地都在召人，路上碰见的十个人里，倒有三四个跟我一样。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The monastery bell used to ring seven times a day. Now it rings through the night as well, for the vigil, they say.","zh":"修道院的钟以前一天敲七回，现在夜里也敲，说是为了守夜。"}}]}}},{"id":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk1.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk1"}},{"id":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk1.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk1"}},{"id":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk1.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk1"}},{"id":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk2","type":"actor/person/traveler","name":{"en":"Silvan Chalkman","zh":"西尔万·垩人"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"altar.whitewick-shrine","x":21,"y":6},"facing":"down","props":{"age":55,"household":"altar.whitewick-shrine.h0","purse":6,"favourite":"item/gem"},"contents":["altar.whitewick-shrine.folk2.coin0","altar.whitewick-shrine.folk2.coin1","altar.whitewick-shrine.folk2.coin2","altar.whitewick-shrine.folk2.coin3","altar.whitewick-shrine.folk2.coin4","altar.whitewick-shrine.folk2.coin5"],"look":{"body":"man","parts":{"hair":"hair.cropped","face":"face.stern","beard":"beard.stubble","age":"age.lined","outfit":"outfit.cloak","legs":"legs.wraps","shoes":"shoes.boots"},"colors":{"skin":"light","hair":"umber","eyes":"bark","outfit.1":"forest","legs.1":"slate","shoes.1":"umber"}},"npc":{"role":"traveler","schedule":[{"from":22,"to":5,"map":"altar.whitewick-shrine","x":14,"y":11,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":5,"to":12,"map":"altar.whitewick-shrine","x":21,"y":6,"activity":"work"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"altar.whitewick-shrine","x":14,"y":11,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"altar.whitewick-shrine","x":21,"y":6,"activity":"work"},{"from":18,"to":22,"map":"altar.whitewick-shrine","x":14,"y":11,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Oh, hello. Can I help you?","zh":"啊，你好。找我有事吗？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Six days on the road to get here, and I've worn through my soles. Is there a cobbler round here?","zh":"我走了六天才到这儿，鞋底都磨穿了。这附近有补鞋的吗？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The monastery bell used to ring seven times a day. Now it rings through the night as well, for the vigil, they say.","zh":"修道院的钟以前一天敲七回，现在夜里也敲，说是为了守夜。"}}]}}},{"id":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk2.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk2"}},{"id":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk2.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk2"}},{"id":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk2.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk2"}},{"id":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk2.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.whitewick-shrine.folk2"}},{"id":"altar.whitewick-shrine.f